meta {
  name: effective settings
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  ~session: {{sessionId}}
}

docs {
  Effective config + per-field provenance + raw layers + file paths. 400 malformed session id, 404 session without workspace.
  
  Fence: host — Loopback fence: the TCP peer must be loopback AND the Host header must be localhost/127.0.0.1/::1. A REST client passes automatically when it targets http://localhost:<port>. A LAN IP or rebound DNS name in the URL answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
